  "serviceTypes": [
    {
      "target": {
        "via": "l1",
        "id": "$service"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "label": "Service",
        "description": "The Solace JMS service type attached to a `jms:Listener` for asynchronous (push-based) consumption.\n\nAn attached service must declare a remote `onMessage` method and may optionally declare an\n`onError` method. The accepted signatures are:\n```ballerina\nremote function onMessage(record {|*jms:Message; T payload;|} message) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(record {|*jms:Message; T payload;|} message, jms:Caller caller) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(jms:Message message) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onError(jms:Error err) returns jms:Error?;\n```\nDeclaring a narrowed `payload` type (`T`) causes the message payload to be data-bound into that\ntype; declaring the base `jms:Message` type yields the raw payload as `anydata`.\nThe subscription (queue or topic) and flow options are supplied via the\n`@jms:ServiceConfig` annotation on the service."
      },
      "service": {
        "description": "The Solace JMS service type attached to a `jms:Listener` for asynchronous (push-based) consumption.\n\nAn attached service must declare a remote `onMessage` method and may optionally declare an\n`onError` method. The accepted signatures are:\n```ballerina\nremote function onMessage(record {|*jms:Message; T payload;|} message) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(record {|*jms:Message; T payload;|} message, jms:Caller caller) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onMessage(jms:Message message) returns jms:Error?;\nremote function onError(jms:Error err) returns jms:Error?;\n```\nDeclaring a narrowed `payload` type (`T`) causes the message payload to be data-bound into that\ntype; declaring the base `jms:Message` type yields the raw payload as `anydata`.\nThe subscription (queue or topic) and flow options are supplied via the\n`@jms:ServiceConfig` annotation on the service.",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "state": {
        "editable": false,
        "enabled": true
      },
      "handlers": [
        {
          "target": {
            "via": "l1",
            "id": "$service.onMessage"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "label": "onMessage",
            "description": "The `onMessage` remote method is triggered when a message is received from the subscribed Solace queue or topic."
          },
          "function": {
            "nameEditable": false,
            "repeatable": "FALSE",
            "canAddParameters": false
          },
          "parameters": [
            {
              "target": {
                "via": "l1",
                "id": "$service.onMessage.message"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "label": "Message",
                "description": "The message received from the Solace queue or topic."
              },
              "fields": [
                {
                  "target": {
                    "via": "semantic",
                    "kind": "recordField",
                    "owner": "message.parameter",
                    "path": "type"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "label": "Parameter Type",
                    "description": "The type of the parameter"
                  },
                  "field": {
                    "key": "type",
                    "default": "",
